exports[`renderIncidentEmail — FR-21, FR-22, FR-24 > FR-24: HTML and text snapshots > text 1`] = `
"LinkWatch · watch.hueai.net

Down


PROBLEMS DETECTED ON ABC.COM

LinkWatch confirmed the following failures (two checks in a row):

https://abc.com/pricing

Type: Dead link

Error: Client error (4xx)

HTTP code: 404

Detected: 2026-09-30 06:04 (GMT+7)

View incident https://watch.hueai.net/incidents/?id=L1%402026-09-29T23%3A04%3A00.000Z

https://shop.abc.com/

Type: Site down

Error: Timed out

Detected: 2026-09-30 06:05 (GMT+7)

View incident https://watch.hueai.net/incidents/?id=L2%402026-09-29T23%3A05%3A00.000Z

https://abc.com/blog

Type: Site down

Error: Server error (5xx)

HTTP code: 503

Detected: 2026-09-30 06:06 (GMT+7)

View incident https://watch.hueai.net/incidents/?id=L3%402026-09-29T23%3A06%3A00.000Z

You receive this email because you are a recipient for this domain or link in LinkWatch. Open LinkWatch https://watch.hueai.net"
`;

